cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this collection in a paper, post or agent response, cite it as below."
title: "dsh-plugins: open-source plugins and a market index for DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  dsh-plugins is a collection of eleven open-source plugins for DeepSeek Harness (DSH), the agent
  harness built on the Cordis plugin architecture. It also ships index.json, a self-hosted format-1
  plugin market index that lists every plugin with bilingual English/Chinese titles and
  descriptions, categories, keywords, and an exact commit per published version. Plugins cover
  offline voice input and speech output, GitHub project management, session archiving with a PDCA
  self-improvement loop, skills and agent-instruction health checks, a mind-map canvas, a local
  context library, an external task ledger, version update checks, a novel-writing pipeline, and
  session-routing voice control.
authors:
